    "title": "First Alert Forecast: Warm and rainy days on the way - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago JACKSON, Miss. (WLBT) - Today: You may need a light jacket heading out the door Tuesday morning as temperatures start out in the low 50s. We will quickly warm up by the afternoon to the low 80s with partly cloudy skies. It will be a milder night as lows only fall to the 60s. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
